{
  "version": "1.0",
  "name": "39 Solar PV Battery Charger (boost)",
  "created": "2026-06-13T15:56:46",
  "modified": "2026-06-13T15:56:46",
  "description": "Photovoltaic charging chain: a PV panel (Isc 8 A, Voc 37 V, ~230 W) feeds a 25 kHz boost converter (fixed D\u22480.45) charging a 48 V battery. The stiff pack clamps the output, so the PV sits in its current region and delivers several amps of charge \u2014 a showcase of the PV_PANEL and BATTERY components.",
